mble.io/)\n\nCompany\n\n- [Careers](https://www.brimble.io/careers)\n- [About](https://www.brimble.io/about)\n- [Branding](https://www.brimble.io/branding)\n\n[Pricing](https://www.brimble.io/pricing)\n\n[Status](https://status.brimble.io/)\n\n[Sign in](https://app.brimble.io/login)\n\n# Careers\n\nWe're building the cloud platform developers actually enjoy using. Small team, big surface area, real ownership. Here's what we're hiring for right now.\n\nOpen roles · 4\n\n[**Developer Relations Associate**\\\\\n\\\\\nRemote (Nigeria)Contract₦500,000–₦700,000/month\\\\\n\\\\\nBe the bridge between Brimble and the developer community: create technical content, run the content calendar, own the docs, and bring developer feedback back to the team.](https://www.brimble.io/careers/developer-relations-associate)\n\n[**Product Manager** Closed\\\\\n\\\\\nMidRemote (Nigeria)Full-time₦700,000/month\\\\\n\\\\\nOwn the roadmap, talk to users, and help decide what we build next on Brimble — a PaaS for developers.](https://www.brimble.io/careers/product-manager)\n\n[**Fullstack / Infra Engineer** Closed\\\\\n\\\\\nRemote (Nigeria)Contract₦1.6M/monthCloses 26 April 2026\\\\\n\\\\\nA take-home task that mirrors how we run Brimble: build a one-page deployment pipeline with Vite + TanStack, an API, Railpack builds, and Caddy ingress.](https://www.brimble.io/careers/fullstack-infra-engineer)\n\n[**Sales Representative** Closed\\\\\n\\\\\nRemote (Nigeria)Contract₦350,000/month + commission on closed deals\\\\\n\\\\\nSell Brimble to developers and organisations, and own the deals that grow our revenue.](https://www.brimble.io/careers/sales-representative)\n\nDon't see the right fit? If you're excited about what we're building, send a note to [hello@brimble.app](mailto:hello@brimble.app).\n\n![Brimble](data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width='24'%20height='26'%20viewBox='0%200%2024.061%2026.2495'%20fill='none'%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3e%3cpath%20d='M12.0303%2010.356C18.6744%2010.356%